#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Run the farm loop for real, in the owner's private server.

    ./.venv/bin/python scripts/run_farm.py [--cycles N] [--pattern NAME]

This is the thing that earns honey: travel to Pine Tree, gather, return, make
honey, repeat. Every number it prints is a reading, never an estimate -- an
unreadable HUD is reported as unreadable rather than as zero.

SAFETY. The panic key (F12) is armed before anything can press a key, all keys
are released on any exit path including a crash, and Ctrl-C stops the loop
cleanly at the next step boundary rather than mid-walk.
"""
